    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "8486b9e183ed352000355cdc2987830799baff0834752ab7dc2f6094354f7619",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 7,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ナルケパフネさんが指さしたところを眺める。\nたしかにだいぶ離れたところでスゥノさんが、\n他のモンスター娘さんたちととっても楽しそうに遊んでいた。",
      "jp_sha256": "402fef58f502b2e264686aedb709ba22b6493817d61852c2fe10f460e6aeeced",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "나르케파프네 씨가 가리킨 곳을 바라보았다.\n확실히 꽤 멀리 떨어진 곳에서 스우노 씨가\n다른 몬스터 소녀들과 무척 즐겁게 놀고 있었다.",
      "message_index_0based": 7,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 31,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b007-20261106-398afd64-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "5ec5cf0486a1483459b266feed49e29bbec64a936deb404d1e426abeae2b6e6b:000002_460613971177390405:g0:r30",
      "row_index_0based": 30,
      "serialized_row_index": 30,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ナルケパフネさんが指さしたところを眺める。\nたしかにだいぶ離れたところでスゥノさんが、\n他のモンスター娘さんたちととっても楽しそうに遊んでいた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "4c9b6d7bb22fd064d963dd4ebe97c093b09d3d854f66017fb99e8354acdd4434",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 8,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "あのね、スゥノちゃんも暑いの苦手なのに、\nどうしてもみんなと海で遊びたいって言うから心配で。\nそれでこっそり付いてきたの。",
      "jp_sha256": "ce7321ba6411093dda770cbc41bde64f41e7440ada2a9b5141ed8b112549aad2",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "있잖아, 스우노도 더위를 잘 못 견디는데,\n어떻게든 다들하고 바다에서 놀고 싶다고 해서 걱정됐거든.\n그래서 몰래 따라왔어.",
      "message_index_0based": 8,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 32,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b007-20261106-398afd64-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "5ec5cf0486a1483459b266feed49e29bbec64a936deb404d1e426abeae2b6e6b:000002_460613971177390405:g0:r31",
      "row_index_0based": 31,
      "serialized_row_index": 31,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
